# The IS Mendelu HTML parsers. CLAUDE.md's Parser Rules freeze them: they are
# extremely brittle, column-index constants are load-bearing, and a change is
# only justified by a real captured IS sample. Even behaviour-preserving
# reformatting is churn in the files where churn is most expensive, so they are
# left exactly as written. Their tests are ordinary code and stay formatted.
src/utils/parsers/**/*.ts
!src/utils/parsers/**/__tests__/**

